WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.631 --> 00:00:16.359
<v><b>Judge 1:</b></v> Dan, Amy and Naomi, come and stand here.

2
00:00:21.571 --> 00:00:28.876
OK, Amy. Very nervous in the beginning! But in the end, very good!

3
00:00:29.561 --> 00:00:32.737
<v><b>Judge 2:</b></v> Yes, a great performance. Well done.

4
00:00:34.697 --> 00:00:38.805
<v><b>Judge 1:</b></v> Dan. In a word… ‘terrible!’.

5
00:00:39.947 --> 00:00:41.982
<v><b>Judge 2:</b></v> Dan, I’m sorry.

6
00:00:42.229 --> 00:00:47.765
You’re good-looking, you move well, but you can’t sing!

7
00:00:49.819 --> 00:00:56.800
<v><b>Judge 1:</b></v> Naomi. Quite good. You have a nice voice.

8
00:00:58.398 --> 00:01:03.382
<v><b>Judge 2:</b></v> Naomi, you have a good voice, but I can’t hear the feeling.

9
00:01:04.314 --> 00:01:09.869
<v><b>Judge 1:</b></v> OK. Dan and Naomi. Thank you very much, but no, thank you.

10
00:01:10.097 --> 00:01:14.434
Amy, congratulations! See you on the show next week.

11
00:01:15.385 --> 00:01:19.266
<v><b>Amy:</b></v> Fantastic! That’s great. Thank you! Thank you!